        <title>Symphony No. 5 in C minor, Op. 67: I. Allegro con brio</title>
        <composer>Ludwig van Beethoven</composer>
      </titleStmt>
      <pubStmt>
        <availability>Public domain. The first movement of Beethoven's Symphony No. 5, Op. 67, as Breitkopf &amp; Härtel printed it in 1862 to 1865 (Ludwig van Beethovens Werke, Serie 1, No. 5). Converted to MEI by HumanityOS (scripts/ly-to-mei.js, 2026-11-20) from Mutopia Project piece 941, typeset in LilyPond by Stelios Samelis, adapted to LilyPond 2.16.2 by Johannes Heinecke, and placed in the public domain by the typesetter (Mutopia-2017/11/05-941). The conversion is dedicated to the public domain (CC0).</availability>
      </pubStmt>
    </fileDesc>
  </meiHead>
